# ExtensionFixes SEO Rules

MUST:
- Every new page needs title, description, canonical, OpenGraph, and Twitter metadata.
- Every new page must be included in sitemap.
- Every relevant new page must be searchable through searchAll.
- Every new page must have homepage, hub, or contextual internal links.
- Core pages should include BreadcrumbList JSON-LD.
- FAQPage JSON-LD is optional, but if used it must match visible FAQ.

SHOULD:
- Use GSC queries to choose new pages.
- Optimize existing pages before creating near-duplicate pages.
- Keep titles natural and query-aligned.

NEVER:
- Do not create orphan pages.
- Do not rely on FAQ rich results.
- Do not use localhost in canonical.
- Do not keyword stuff titles.
